<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@/~part_III__chp_3__cl_31__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Tertakluk kepada subseksyen (4), (5), (6), (7) dan (8), tiap-tiap orang yang dibantu hendaklah membayar kepada Ketua Pengarah suatu kos kepeguaman."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@/~part_III__chp_3__cl_31__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@/~part_III__chp_3__cl_31> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@> .
