<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_60__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_60__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Jika tertuduh yang dibantu tidak berpuas hati dengan mana-mana keputusan mahkamah dan ingin merayu terhadap keputusan mahkamah itu, tertuduh yang dibantu hendaklah memohon perakuan baharu bagi maksud rayuan tersebut."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_60__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_60> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_60__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_60__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_60__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Permohonan bagi khidmat pembelaan awam di bawah subseksyen (1) hendaklah disifatkan sebagai suatu permohonan baharu bagi khidmat pembelaan awam."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_60__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_60> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_60__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_60__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@/~part_IV__cl_60__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Seksyen 53, 54, 56, 57, 58 dan 59 hendaklah terpakai mutatis mutandis bagi permohonan untuk khidmat pembelaan awam di bawah seksyen ini."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2025/24/msa@> .
